<title>USA: St. Louis Cty HRA, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>St. Louis Cty HRA, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $5.275 million of St. Louis Cty Housing and Redevelopment Authority, Minn., law enforcement facilities revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.18 percent.</p>
